===== Specific Configuration =====

==== Network interfaces ====
The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description                  ^ Default configuration    ^
| br-lan           | Lan & WiFi                   | 192.168.1.1/24           |
| vlan1 (eth0.1)   | Parent of br-lan             | see br-lan               |
| vlan2 (eth0.2)   | WAN port                     | DHCP                     |
| wlan0            | 2.4 GHz WiFi                 | Disabled                 |
| wlan1            | 5 GHz WiFi                   | Disabled                 |

==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====
Numbers 1-5 are Ports 1-5 as labeled on the unit, number 5 is the Internet (WAN) on the unit, 0 is the internal connection to the router itself.
^ Port             ^ Switch port   ^
| Internet (WAN)   | 5             |
| LAN 1            | 1            |
| LAN 2            | 2             |
| LAN 3            | 3             |
| LAN 4            | 4             |

