==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

How to connect to the Serial Port of this specific device:\\

Need to solder on a header.  (see below)

{{:media:powercloud_systems:skydog-serial1_-annoted.png?400|}}


Pin 1 is marked with an arrow and is partly covered by the wireless antenna pigtail above.

^Pin    |   4   |   3   |   2   |   1  |
^Signal |   RX  |  TX   |  GND  |   VCC  |

Vcc is 3.3V NOT 5V (so a PL2023 or FTDI 3.3V cable is appropriate).


^ Serial connection parameters\\ for PowerCloud Systems CR5000 | 115200, 8N1 |


